    <briefdescription>
<para>base class for CSMP-specific exception handling using an exception qualifier (<ref refid="namespacecsmp_1a6a7cd0f08693c4632eea521f4ab13cb8" kindref="member">CSMP_MESSAGE</ref>), an originator (the class and method from where the exception comes from, and a string that contains the message that describes what happened locally. </para>
    </briefdescription>
    <detaileddescription>
<para><simplesect kind="note"><para>no need to use a <ref refid="classcsmp_1_1_exception" kindref="compound">csmp::Exception</ref> if the case is well described by one of the standard exceptions.</para>
</simplesect>
<simplesect kind="author"><para>Stephan Matthai </para>
</simplesect>
<simplesect kind="date"><para>1999 </para>
</simplesect>
</para>
    </detaileddescription>
